text:
FALCON: &gt;&gt;
Story: It was raining heavily outside, but one person stood tall, unafraid of the showers. Under the protection of their umbrella, they continued on their journey. The downpour had stopped, but the world was still soaked. However, the cheerful person with an umbrella in hand was unfazed. As they gazed around, they felt an overwhelming sense of contentment.

They looked up and saw a magnificent rainbow arching across the sky
